CHANGES MADE TO THE DERIVED CODE
================================

As required by section 5(a) of the AGPL. This list is maintained as the work
proceeds.

  * Renamed the namespace, assembly and plugin identity from QuestTracker to
    Time Memoria. Plugin metadata (author, description, repository, tags)
    replaced throughout.
  * Nested the quest tree under expansion, taken from the Quest sheet's own
    Expansion column, and moved the existing category and tribe ordering down
    a level to suit.
  * Replaced the Overview with a per-expansion breakdown and a suggested next
    quest.
  * Replaced the dropdown quest navigation with a two-panel tree, a draggable
    divider, and a quest list showing completion, level, title and area.
  * Added a Progression tab: class and job levels with experience, and two
    clipboard exports.
  * Added a News tab reporting maintenance windows and events from an external
    feed.
  * Added playtime tracking per character.
  * Grouped the Excel sheets once at startup instead of filtering whole sheets
    inside nested loops, which reduced plugin load from roughly 2,230ms to
    roughly 220ms on a warm reload.

Planned, not yet done:

  * MSQ progression gating, spoiler mode and free-trial mode.
  * Replace quest-ID probing for starting city, Grand Company and starting
    class with the equivalent PlayerState fields.


